{%- comment -%}
  A link to a page that does not exist yet (Victor, 19 Oct 2026): shown, not clickable (no href,
  aria-disabled), with a tooltip on hover, keyboard focus and tap; Escape hides it.
  The calling section loads kc-coming-soon.css (render-blocking, before this markup) and
  kc-coming-soon.js.

  Accepts:
  - id {String}: element id; the tooltip gets id + '-soon'
  - label {String}: the link or button text (escaped here)
  - class {String}: the host's own classes (menu item, button)
  - icon {String}: optional markup after the label, e.g. a button's arrow
  - tip {String}: optional tooltip text; blank uses the translated kc.general.coming_soon

  Usage:
  {% render 'kc-coming-soon', id: 'HeaderMenu-about', label: link.title, class: 'header__menu-item' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign soon_tip = tip
  if soon_tip == blank
    assign soon_tip = 'kc.general.coming_soon' | t
  endif
-%}
<a
  id="{{ id }}"
  class="{{ class }} kc-coming-soon"
  role="link"
  aria-disabled="true"
  tabindex="0"
  aria-describedby="{{ id }}-soon"
>
  <span>{{- label | escape -}}</span>
  {{- icon -}}
  <span id="{{ id }}-soon" class="kc-coming-soon__tip" role="tooltip">
    {{- soon_tip | escape -}}
  </span>
</a>
